    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8985b1b601238a596615acec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她第一次真心对闪耀系列赛的世界\n产生兴趣、接触之后，在那里感觉到了\n赛跑魔法具有可能性。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27bfd83c3b0d8ea4eab667fbe37cd59227630b302a714588ec7b71ef5e2d10a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044202.json",
      "json_path": [
