      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d85b09ff3a53d8e7a79f0a79",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的条件只有一个，\n“必须是我会喜欢的地方”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c07219febf6b28098b7cabc5abc695230107c08f2b83cc0ad63521c779095b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccfbf796dfc5ecfb474f4924",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这一定是因为闪耀系列赛是\n能让人们和赛马娘们为之疯狂、\n着迷不已的“特别”舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d79d151cfb0ad0b50df8853c679253f6d9ccb0273568d350b8ee1b988f5c9cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aad349e96a0202a0b246cd3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……让比赛变得更“特别”吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "465f658f9348fb0fd92f5d92ca105fc47abb163a2365398b4e70abc778c671d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d16005765ef6be5246953b31",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果赛跑魔法具备的可能性\n就隐藏在“特别”的状况中──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9718bd1de33c648345125fbb00cbd49f8f4d7b9ac6bd86ad61e6dfb65a9eed4e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4337daa49c89be6a3dc6ed6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "坦白讲，我也还不太清楚──",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fea61d9048d527f301a95fa39fc704dd163495a5866035de09b1533cd8c26c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8970c6566d44d37c326e3df3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东商变革",
      "source_fingerprint": "7281a4e36830a49e7bf9024c39a41d6bf86957e1a7ed32a98967bb65c8a03663",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
