    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42ea0e8688e89ed6ab49043c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“特别的比赛”？\n……那是什么意思？",
      "source_fingerprint": "55a8e55fe82a65b9baccae4567e630ea7fda8b4f1e1437c077302d0e77f7c46c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1051f87bb2d4efda31b39914",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们的目标是“樱花赏”",
      "source_fingerprint": "1567fab8c4166da06d76cab50624e636e1fb27a65efeb39c97aa902fc93a8a23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b7ecf6a88c8a5189d050e6a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们的目标是“樱花赏”",
      "source_fingerprint": "1567fab8c4166da06d76cab50624e636e1fb27a65efeb39c97aa902fc93a8a23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
