    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69b930fb6896bdb67e37340e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但我表示照这个方向前进，\n应该有很大的机会能够找到答案。\n这是因为……",
      "source_fingerprint": "488dcd1b73cc8a0370ba1774c12b4f15249f9e29914e688919878ababa833418",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca7d925a051f168c3e81b38a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是赛马娘在一生中只有一次机会，\n赌上自己的尊严和灵魂，\n发挥所有实力挑战的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d743e0d5903e990b60686a2b4b07ae98870ab0485f3c49d7308162ab3a1cd37d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32e9d3a5b2c0ae4e6fccc089",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eddf4a46a4aeb97f0a7a6b5388a34f68ce45c618173340380417c05287c1632",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
